OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor sacked after posting
OL,4,Asexualised AI image of colleague
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reform UK politician has been sacked
OL,7,Ffrom his senior council post after he
OL,8,Fposted a sexualised AI-generated image
OL,9,Fof a female colleague on social media.
OL,11,FThe since-deleted post was published on
OL,12,FX by Chris Hudson, cabinet member for
OL,13,Fhighways and transport at Suffolk
OL,14,FCounty Council, at 15:44 GMT on Monday.
OL,16,FIt included an image which showed
OL,17,Ffellow Reform councillor June Mummery
OL,18,Fin a tight, sequined bra with the
OL,19,Fslogan "I saved the Suffolk school
OL,20,Fnurses!".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
