OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor sacked after posting
OL,4,Asexualised AI image of colleague
OL,5,
OL,6,FHudson was removed from his cabinet
OL,7,Fposition but defended the post, telling
OL,8,Fthe BBC he intended for it to come
OL,9,Facross in a "girl power way" and had
OL,10,Fsent a copy of it to Mummery, who was
OL,11,F"definitely on board" with it.
